{"repositoryId":1416832583,"availability":"available","full":"alb777/dubwise","name":"dubwise","description":"A dub sound system in your browser: describe a riddim in your own words and it plays. Synthesized, offline, live-codeable console.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-13T10:16:59Z","updated":"2026-10-17T09:15:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://alb777.github.io/dubwise/","topics":["drum-machine","dub","live-coding","music-generation","offline-first","pwa","reggae","step-sequencer","synthesizer","web-audio"],"demo":"https://alb777.github.io/dubwise/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:00.894Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:00.894Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:00.894Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T11:32:00.894Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A dub sound system in your browser. Describe a riddim in your own words and it plays: synthesized drums and bass, tape echo, spring reverb, siren and dub effects, with a console you can live-code. No samples, no account, no install, and it works offline."],"features":["Describe a riddim in English, Portuguese or Spanish: inspired by Augustus Pablo, a slow one drop for a rainy night, Metallica meets King Tubby. Then steer it: darker, a bit faster, more echo.","Mix it like dub: mute, solo, hold throw to send a channel into the echo, sweep the filter, play the siren.","Hit the effects: spring crash, echo spin, air horn, phaser, low and high kills, tape stop and pull up.","Play the melodica: keys brings out a keyboard under the desk. Play it with the mouse, a finger or the computer keys whose letters are printed on it, with the riddim's scale marked.","Edit and live-code: click the grid, or type a line like bpm 76 or kick x...x...x...x...."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alb777/dubwise/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"06ff70a1e637b2f8fe4